OL,3,AEngland's mayors to get power to impose
OL,4,Atourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayors in England will be given the
OL,7,Fpower to impose a new fee on overnight
OL,8,Fstays, in a move the government says
OL,9,Fwill mean more money can be invested
OL,10,Finto local areas.
OL,12,FUnder the plans, local leaders will be
OL,13,Fable to bring in an uncapped levy,
OL,14,Fdubbed a "tourist tax", as a percentage
OL,15,Fof the cost of hotels, bed and
OL,16,Fbreakfasts and other types of
OL,17,Faccommodation rather than a flat fee.
OL,19,FHospitality leaders have warned it will
OL,20,Fput jobs at risk and hit families in
OL,21,Fthe pocket.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
